   364	total number of steps in the traces, which do not include the initial
   365	state output of each trace. It can easily be seen from Equation 6
   366	that the number of soft clauses is exactly _𝑡_ _𝑠𝑡𝑒𝑝𝑠_ . Because ∃ ! _𝑥_ ∈
