   460	### Benchmarks
   461	
   462	All of our benchmarks were generated using the following procedure:
   463	
   464	1. Select a number of parameters for generation and inferring
   465	2. Generate a random Moore machine using AALpy and the given parameters
   466	3. Query the generated Moore machine and record the observations as traces
   467	4. Inject faults into the traces, e.g., by dropping steps
   468	5. Use PMSAT inference to learn from the noisy traces and
   469	6. Save results and stats, such as solve time, correctness and more
